  "status": "proposed",
  "designPrinciples": [
    "Industry overlays extend universal capability definitions; they never mutate the universal catalog.",
    "Specialized capabilities have stable overlay-local IDs and retain a base universal capability lineage.",
    "All records remain proposed and applicability remains unassessed until reviewed with evidence.",
    "Industry capability names are illustrative modeling candidates, not approved standards."
